# VROO Core Rule
- Read `AGENTS.md` before doing any work.
- Communicate in Korean unless code or established technical terms require English.
- Inspect before editing; do not invent existing architecture.
- Prefer minimal, reversible, reviewable changes.
- Do not ask the owner about implementation details that can be safely inferred.
- Record material assumptions in the PR description.
- Never merge to main automatically.
